cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CityGML 2.0 + Energy ADE 3.0 Creator"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit that generates CityGML 2.0 files extended with Energy ADE
  3.0 (beta 8) from flat JSON input plus STEP or CityJSON geometry. It runs a
  per-building pipeline and a city-scale pipeline that both emit the same wire
  format, developed for building renovation passports within the RenoDAT
  project at Delft University of Technology.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Schlosser
    given-names: Daan
    affiliation: "Delft University of Technology"
    email: daan.schlosser@gmail.com
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DaanSchlosser/CityGML2.0-EnergyADE3.0_creator"
keywords:
  - CityGML
  - Energy ADE
  - building renovation passport
  - RenoDAT
  - GML
  - 3D city model
  - energy data
